{"kind":"liwegraph/v1","data":{"groups":[],"nodes":[{"id":"human","label":"You","kind":"human","content":{"$text":"You state what you want to understand, inspect the result against your intent or source evidence, and decide the next question. Visual verification is your responsibility."}},{"id":"agent","label":"Agent","kind":"agent","content":{"$text":"An external AI agent interprets your requirements or source material and edits the graph's semantic data: node identities, groups, relationships and notes. It does not need to position boxes or route edges. Its interpretation may be wrong."}},{"id":"document","label":".liwegraph document","kind":"object","content":{"$text":"The portable document keeps semantic data, derived layout and appearance in separate fields. The agent edits data for this workflow. The canonical materialiser may replace stored layout without changing semantic relationships or appearance."}},{"id":"tool","label":"LIWE Graph toolkit","kind":"tool","content":{"$text":"Validates the document structure, deterministically materialises layout for a given input and implementation version, and renders a browser view or standalone SVG. Validation does not verify domain truth."}},{"id":"view","label":"Rendered graph","kind":"object","content":{"$text":"A visual presentation of the graph document. A browser host can mount an interactive view with selectable node content; the CLI exports a static SVG. The image is not the editable source."}}],"edges":[{"from":"human","to":"agent","index":1,"kind":"relation","label":"1 · states intent"},{"from":"agent","to":"document","index":1,"kind":"action","label":"2 · edits data"},{"from":"tool","to":"document","index":1,"kind":"action","label":"4 · computes layout"},{"from":"tool","to":"view","index":1,"kind":"action","label":"5 · renders"},{"from":"human","to":"view","index":1,"kind":"action","label":"6 · inspects"},{"from":"human","to":"agent","index":2,"kind":"relation","label":"7 · asks again"},{"from":"agent","to":